    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90838" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρυμν-ήτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>steersman</i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρας
				τῆσδε π. ἄναξ</span> '<i>the pilot</i>' of the State,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνδρα . . π. χθονός</span> ib.
				<i><span class="en">
